        "filename": "Pyongyang-May-2005.JPG",
        "caption": "Pyongyang, North Korea as seen from the Juche Tower, facing west across the Taedong river. The large square in the centre is Kim Il-Sung Square; the large building behind it is the Grand People's Study House. The massive triangular building on the right of the photo is the Ryugyong Hotel.\nThe haze was due to forest fires near the China/Mongolia border, and is not the smog typical of large East Asian cities. (Photograph taken with a Canon PowerShot A85)",
